{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Let her not be, please, as one dead.</b> El now let not our sister be like the fall of the dead as when he emerges from his mother's womb — half his flesh consumed. So too the flesh of the metzora. And there is no need for a scribal emendation."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:24.479865409Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}